c:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"prose-legal space-y-4 py-8","children":[["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink","children":"Privacy Policy"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-ink/50","children":["Last updated: 8 November 2026 - Applies to ","CekAPK","."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/80","children":["We collect as little data as possible. We do not sell personal data. Personal data is processed in accordance with Indonesia's Personal Data Protection Act (UU PDP) as relevant; other privacy laws may also apply depending on your location and applicable law. You may request access, correction, and deletion of your personal data through the Contact page (","kontak@cekapk.com",")."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-ink","children":"Downloader Tools (TikTok & Instagram)"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/80","children":"When you paste a link, our server fetches information and video from that link only to give you the result you asked for. We do not store the videos or photos you process. The tools' technical logs store only anonymous metadata (time, success or failure) and never write the full URL to the log; any full URL held temporarily is deleted within 24 hours."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-ink","children":"Permission Checker (Screenshots)"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/80","children":"Screenshots you upload are processed on our own server with Tesseract OCR (Indonesian + English) — images are not sent to any third-party OCR or AI service, and are not used to train models. The image is written to a temporary file only while OCR is running (a matter of seconds), then deleted. All we record is anonymous metadata: how many permissions were found and how many are high-risk — without the image content and without the app name. Uploads are limited to a maximum of 8 MB and to PNG, JPG, or WebP only; other formats are rejected by the server."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-ink","children":"Legal APK Library & Reports"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/80","children":"Files in the Legal APK Library come only from the site administrator and are only published after passing the verification pipeline (see the Verification Methodology page). For published files, we show the SHA-256 hash, the signature fingerprint, the scan result, and its permissions — that is data about the file, not about visitors. Security or DMCA reports you send by email are used only to handle that report, with a review target of 2 business days."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-ink","children":"Server Logs, Cookies, Analytics & Advertising"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/80","children":"Server logs store anonymous technical metadata for security and improvement (time, tool success) — not the content of your uploads. The site currently does not use Google Analytics and does not display third-party advertising, so no analytics or advertising tracker collects your data. Essential functional cookies may be used currently for site functions (for example, your dark/light theme choice); advertising cookies are not currently operating. You can delete cookies at any time through your browser settings."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-ink","children":"Future Advertising (Google AdSense and Other Third-Party Providers)"}],"$L10","$L11","$L12"]}],null,"$L13"]}]
