10:["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/80","children":["This section describes a future possibility, not a current practice: ","CekAPK"," does not currently display advertisements, and no advertising cookies are currently operating on this site. In the future, ","CekAPK"," may use Google AdSense or other third-party advertising providers. If advertising is shown, advertising providers may use cookies or similar technologies, and may set their own cookies, subject to applicable consent requirements; Google and its partners may use information to serve, personalize, measure, and limit advertisements, as applicable. Users can manage advertising personalization through Google Ads Settings (My Ad Center) at https://myadcenter.google.com/ or www.aboutads.info/choices. Third-party providers process data under their own privacy policies; Google's advertising privacy documentation is available at https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads. If advertising is activated for visitors in regions that require consent, ","CekAPK"," will implement a Google-certified consent management platform and configure it before serving ads where required."]}]
11:["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-ink","children":"Data Requests & Deletion"}]
12:["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/80","children":["To request access, correction, or deletion of your personal data, send an email to ","kontak@cekapk.com"," with the subject \"Personal Data Request\" and describe the data involved. We target a reply within 2 business days. Requests will be reviewed and handled. Because our tools do not store your uploads, there is usually no visitor file to delete. However, certain records — including emails and reports you sent yourself — may need to be retained where required or permitted by applicable law, for security, or for legitimate operational requirements."]}]
